From: Kimi <kimi@moonhands.sg>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 00:23:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: always try all 360dialog endpoints on any HTTP error

- Remove break-on-400 logic that stopped retry after first failure
- Now tries v2 -> waba -> sandbox sequentially regardless of error type
- Fixes issue where HTTP 400 on v2 prevented fallback endpoints from being attempted
